 "note": "M, 15 platforms, open, inward. A hexagon of platforms round a 6-bridge switch hub (Forge): state 1 bridges the bottom centre and the two top sides, state 2 the top centre and the two bottom sides (review 2026-09-29), so every fire moves all three roads into the hub. The hub has no fixed deck; its bridges hold it in every state (a relay hub). Braided pockets outside. Survivor ring: the hub and the hexagon.",
